#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""XLIN Files - the XLIN file manager (browse, search, copy/move, trash and restore, drag and drop).

Usage: xlin-files [folder]

Keys: Enter/double-click open | Backspace or Alt+Up parent | Alt+Left/Right back/forward
      F2 rename | Delete move to trash | Ctrl+Shift+N new folder | Ctrl+H hidden files
      Ctrl+L type a path | F5 refresh | Ctrl+F search (Enter = search subfolders)
      Right-click for a menu. Ctrl+C copy | Ctrl+X cut | Ctrl+V paste | Ctrl+A select all | drag items onto a folder to move
"""
